  "description": "“I’m excited to introduce you to my signature bike. The Taj bike has always been about blending the tough and simple sensibilities of a BMX bike with a frame size that you can also comfortably sit down and pedal. This year’s model makes the jump to 27.5” wheels which are still agile enough for playing around, and even better for cruisin’. The frame, fork, handlebars, and cranks are all reliable chromoly. The single-speed drivetrain and Odyssey brakes are as dependable and straightforward as they can possibly be. The Taj is a bike that is fun to ride, made to last and a breeze to keep rolling. I hope you’ll give it a try.”\n\n-Taj Mihelich\n\nAvailable in Translucent Winter Blue with 27.5\" wheels.",
